WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
Set a bar in squat stands at hip height and hang under it, arms straight, heels down.

2
00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:04.640
Keep your body straight and pull your chest up to touch the bar.

3
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.960
Lower slowly until your arms are straight again.
